(5959717, 870706, 113142, '<td valign="top">Extremely creative imagery.</td>', 'Extremely creative imagery.', '2010-04-21 02:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5959725, 869352, 116499, '<td valign="top">If you had crouched down more for a stronger angle on the rocks, this would have been a pretty strong picture, especially if you had chosen an aperture between 1.4 and 5.6. That said, the square rocks trip up my traditional notion of ''zen'' but still work very well.</td>', 'If you had crouched down more for a stronger angle on the rocks, this would have been a pretty strong picture, especially if you had chosen an aperture between 1.4 and 5.6. That said, the square rocks trip up my traditional notion of ''zen'' but still work very well.', '2010-04-21 02:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5959730, 868518, 113142, '<td valign="top">Complacent, indeed! Never seen one sit still long enough! Good pic, but next time please try not to make sooo small. 800 pixels along the longest edge seems to work well.</td>', 'Complacent, indeed! Never seen one sit still long enough! Good pic, but next time please try not to make sooo small. 800 pixels along the longest edge seems to work well.', '2010-04-21 02:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
