(5960709, 871317, 103310, '<td valign="top">The photograph is not really sharp. Sin of the colour noise. Lower ISO (but then with adapted sluiter time and f value) possibly the colour noise are able reduce.</td>', 'The photograph is not really sharp. Sin of the colour noise. Lower ISO (but then with adapted sluiter time and f value) possibly the colour noise are able reduce.', '2010-04-21 09:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5960711, 870700, 15711, '<td valign="top">So artfully presented.  Her face is so beautiful but somehow the blur of her kimono is a bit distracting since the color is more vivid than that around her eye. It''s still gorgeous.</td>', 'So artfully presented.  Her face is so beautiful but somehow the blur of her kimono is a bit distracting since the color is more vivid than that around her eye. It''s still gorgeous.', '2010-04-21 09:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
