(5960719, 871169, 65234, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to realize I was looking at a Kanji; then I had to go look it up and see which one it was ;-)  It''s been YEARS since I could read Kanji without looking it up!  Zen; duh!  Bonus point for evoking personal nostalgia.</td>', 'Took me a second to realize I was looking at a Kanji; then I had to go look it up and see which one it was ;-)  It''s been YEARS since I could read Kanji without looking it up!  Zen; duh!  Bonus point for evoking personal nostalgia.', '2010-04-21 09:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5960721, 869046, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. I am a sucker for a silhouette.</td>', 'This is lovely. I am a sucker for a silhouette.', '2010-04-21 09:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5960725, 869899, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  I might have cropped it so that the rock in the foreground was not there, as it is so prominent and confuses my eye a bit. 6</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  I might have cropped it so that the rock in the foreground was not there, as it is so prominent and confuses my eye a bit. 6', '2010-04-21 09:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
