(5960733, 871605, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  What a gorgeous painterly image.  One of my favorites.  I''d love to see this (without the border) on a HUGE canvas.  It''s magical.</td>', 'Oh wow.  What a gorgeous painterly image.  One of my favorites.  I''d love to see this (without the border) on a HUGE canvas.  It''s magical.', '2010-04-21 10:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
