(5960740, 869348, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus. I love the diagonal of the leaf, ending in the concentric circles in the water.  Very nice.</td>', 'Perfect focus. I love the diagonal of the leaf, ending in the concentric circles in the water.  Very nice.', '2010-04-21 10:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
