(5963568, 871270, 50695, '<td valign="top">The jazz man went to the Zen master seeking enlightenment.<br/> <br/>"Oh Master, I lost my enlightenment," he said.<br/> <br/>"There''s a piano out back," answered the master.<br/> <br/>The musician went to the back of the house and returned.<br/> <br/>"There is no piano," he said.<br/> <br/>"Did you lose the piano?" asked the master.<br/> <br/>And at that moment, the jazz man regained enlightenment.</td>', 'The jazz man went to the Zen master seeking enlightenment. "Oh Master, I lost my enlightenment," he said. "There''s a piano out back," answered the master. The musician went to the back of the house and returned. "There is no piano," he said. "Did you lose the piano?" asked the master. And at that moment, the jazz man regained enlightenment.', '2010-04-22 13:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5963569, 868111, 50695, '<td valign="top">The poor tenant complained to the Zen master, "my house is dirty. My wife never cleans it."<br/> <br/>The Zen Master replied, "cover your face with dirt."</td>', 'The poor tenant complained to the Zen master, "my house is dirty. My wife never cleans it." The Zen Master replied, "cover your face with dirt."', '2010-04-22 13:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
