(5963576, 870940, 50695, '<td valign="top">The man who lost his enlightenment went to the Zen master.<br/> <br/>"How do I find my enlightenment again?" he asked.<br/> <br/>"Do you remember having enlightenment?" asked the master.<br/> <br/>"Yes, oh yes, so vividly," he replied.<br/> <br/>"You cannot gain enlightenment for that man, because he already has enlightenment. Enlightenment is only possible for the man who doesn''t have it."</td>', 'The man who lost his enlightenment went to the Zen master. "How do I find my enlightenment again?" he asked. "Do you remember having enlightenment?" asked the master. "Yes, oh yes, so vividly," he replied. "You cannot gain enlightenment for that man, because he already has enlightenment. Enlightenment is only possible for the man who doesn''t have it."', '2010-04-22 13:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
