(5963819, 871497, 73452, '<td valign="top">There seems to be alot of noise in this image, and the red fringing on the edge of the trees is distracting.  But its a beautiful scene.</td>', 'There seems to be alot of noise in this image, and the red fringing on the edge of the trees is distracting.  But its a beautiful scene.', '2010-04-22 16:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
