(5967417, 870292, 106910, '<td valign="top">I absolutely, 100%, love this photo. I must know how you did the top portion of the photo! 10</td>', 'I absolutely, 100%, love this photo. I must know how you did the top portion of the photo! 10', '2010-04-25 03:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
