(5967553, 870512, 97559, '<td valign="top">Panoramic photograph that perfectly captures the essence of zen.</td>', 'Panoramic photograph that perfectly captures the essence of zen.', '2010-04-25 07:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967592, 870852, 12674, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and shallow DOF, just a really nice shot!</td>', 'I like the perspective and shallow DOF, just a really nice shot!', '2010-04-25 09:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967596, 870548, 12674, '<td valign="top">Better focus on Buddha rather than foreground branch might draw more interest to your subject.</td>', 'Better focus on Buddha rather than foreground branch might draw more interest to your subject.', '2010-04-25 09:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967607, 870872, 12674, '<td valign="top">Very quiet, simple, and soothing. Nice.</td>', 'Very quiet, simple, and soothing. Nice.', '2010-04-25 09:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967611, 870732, 115814, '<td valign="top">The composition is quite effective. I think the fine detail of the flower against the back could have been larger for better clarity. This may be fine in print or greater enlargement, but with a 640 pixel limit there''s too much detail loss for my taste....==</td>', 'The composition is quite effective. I think the fine detail of the flower against the back could have been larger for better clarity. This may be fine in print or greater enlargement, but with a 640 pixel limit there''s too much detail loss for my taste....==', '2010-04-25 09:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967612, 871495, 12674, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting but could be more sharply focused.</td>', 'I like the backlighting but could be more sharply focused.', '2010-04-25 09:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967615, 868307, 115814, '<td valign="top">Amen. You may now be seated!</td>', 'Amen. You may now be seated!', '2010-04-25 09:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967617, 870906, 12674, '<td valign="top">A nice clear shot but the subject lacks interest.</td>', 'A nice clear shot but the subject lacks interest.', '2010-04-25 09:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967619, 870747, 115814, '<td valign="top">Wow. The color gradation from the outside of the petals to the yellow is amazing. The shadows at the center give a strong effect of depth. Nice work!</td>', 'Wow. The color gradation from the outside of the petals to the yellow is amazing. The shadows at the center give a strong effect of depth. Nice work!', '2010-04-25 09:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967621, 871228, 12674, '<td valign="top">I really like the selected area of focus. Nice shot!</td>', 'I really like the selected area of focus. Nice shot!', '2010-04-25 09:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967622, 870700, 115814, '<td valign="top">Very creative color and exposure range. I''m still not sure whether the subtle cheek line is really there or totally implied against the white background. Nice.</td>', 'Very creative color and exposure range. I''m still not sure whether the subtle cheek line is really there or totally implied against the white background. Nice.', '2010-04-25 09:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967624, 868799, 12674, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and unusual composition. I might''ve cropped the top ever so slightly to eliminate the tops of the light poles, which are distracting.</td>', 'I like the subject and unusual composition. I might''ve cropped the top ever so slightly to eliminate the tops of the light poles, which are distracting.', '2010-04-25 09:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967625, 867641, 12674, '<td valign="top">Maybe more tension than Zen?</td>', 'Maybe more tension than Zen?', '2010-04-25 09:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967626, 869888, 115814, '<td valign="top">The image alone is quite strking... the implication that that feather has created the ripple is thought-provoking and clever. Vignetting on three of four corners is subtle. I like this more, the more I look at it. Kudos!</td>', 'The image alone is quite strking... the implication that that feather has created the ripple is thought-provoking and clever. Vignetting on three of four corners is subtle. I like this more, the more I look at it. Kudos!', '2010-04-25 09:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967627, 871559, 115814, '<td valign="top">In response to the title... the longer you look, the more you see. My first impression was very positive for this image... then I started to be distracted by the lighting umbrella and silhouette  of the photographer that is reflected in the water beads.</td>', 'In response to the title... the longer you look, the more you see. My first impression was very positive for this image... then I started to be distracted by the lighting umbrella and silhouette  of the photographer that is reflected in the water beads.', '2010-04-25 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967629, 871049, 115814, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I should like this as well as I do. Very simple, interesting and unusual composition. I just can''t decide if sending my eye to the lower left is working. It seems that my eyes don''t ever get settled looking at it, but keep wandering diagonally lower left to upper right... an interesting paradox for a theme of silence/stillness. Hmmm....</td>', 'I don''t think I should like this as well as I do. Very simple, interesting and unusual composition. I just can''t decide if sending my eye to the lower left is working. It seems that my eyes don''t ever get settled looking at it, but keep wandering diagonally lower left to upper right... an interesting paradox for a theme of silence/stillness. Hmmm....', '2010-04-25 09:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967633, 871089, 115814, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. In a perfect world for me, the upper right flower would be more consistent in lighting and orientation with the other two. Darn it... why can''t nature be more cooperative?</td>', 'Beautiful. In a perfect world for me, the upper right flower would be more consistent in lighting and orientation with the other two. Darn it... why can''t nature be more cooperative?', '2010-04-25 09:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967641, 868797, 23317, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  It''s a nit-picky thing, but the motor doesn''t say "zen" to me.  Other than that, very well done.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  It''s a nit-picky thing, but the motor doesn''t say "zen" to me.  Other than that, very well done.', '2010-04-25 09:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967658, 871280, 28427, '<td valign="top">What a balancing act :) Photographs like these always makes me wonder how it''s done, what''s the creativity behind it.  I also like the light very much.</td>', 'What a balancing act :) Photographs like these always makes me wonder how it''s done, what''s the creativity behind it.  I also like the light very much.', '2010-04-25 10:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967666, 871518, 28427, '<td valign="top">Simple yet so beautiful *10*</td>', 'Simple yet so beautiful *10*', '2010-04-25 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
