(5971761, 871017, 115906, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity &amp; clarity of this image, may have been a cleaner shot without the greenery though.</td>', 'I like the simplicity & clarity of this image, may have been a cleaner shot without the greenery though.', '2010-04-26 15:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
