(5973901, 867794, 66635, '<td valign="top">I was going with it until I realized that that''s Alcatraz in the background and that it used to be full of, in the words of Arlo Guthrie, "All kinds of mean, nasty, ugly people ... mother-rapers, father-stabbers and father-rapers..." which made me think of war and then thinking of all that bad stuff made me totally lose my zen feeling and get all upset!<br/> <br/>Nice pic, though.</td>', 'I was going with it until I realized that that''s Alcatraz in the background and that it used to be full of, in the words of Arlo Guthrie, "All kinds of mean, nasty, ugly people ... mother-rapers, father-stabbers and father-rapers..." which made me think of war and then thinking of all that bad stuff made me totally lose my zen feeling and get all upset! Nice pic, though.', '2010-04-27 10:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973905, 871295, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nothing more peaceful than fly fishing!  You get a ten from me!</td>', 'Nothing more peaceful than fly fishing!  You get a ten from me!', '2010-04-27 10:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973924, 868262, 61961, '<td valign="top">I appreciate all the negative space up top, though I think nevertheless this could use a litle more space (distance between berry and frame) at the bottom.  Nicely done.<br/> <br/>Back to bump this up. :-)</td>', 'I appreciate all the negative space up top, though I think nevertheless this could use a litle more space (distance between berry and frame) at the bottom.  Nicely done. Back to bump this up. :-)', '2010-04-27 10:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973925, 870519, 82999, '<td valign="top">No to be too picky here, but they are not bonsai, which literally means "tree in a pot."  And they are really too large.  <br/> <br/>That said, I like the shot anyway.  What garden is it?</td>', 'No to be too picky here, but they are not bonsai, which literally means "tree in a pot."  And they are really too large.   That said, I like the shot anyway.  What garden is it?', '2010-04-27 10:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973932, 868850, 100335, '<td valign="top">Wonderful imagei love the smoothness of the sky and the detail on the bird.<br/> <br/>2 things though: I personally don''t like the abundance of empty space in the image, and as a whole i don''t sense a "silent" subject, i can almost hear the bird''s "CACAWWW"</td>', 'Wonderful imagei love the smoothness of the sky and the detail on the bird. 2 things though: I personally don''t like the abundance of empty space in the image, and as a whole i don''t sense a "silent" subject, i can almost hear the bird''s "CACAWWW"', '2010-04-27 10:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
