(5977351, 871275, 28427, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get it.  I mean, I don''t get how this didn''t score any higher.<br/>The simplicity, the reflection, the gradient: al these elements are contributing to the calmness in this photograph.  Looking at it, my eyes go from top left to bottom right to find a place to rest on.  This is the reed with the most sharpness and is the resting place for the eye. The fact that the other reeds are not as sharp, gives that part of the photograph calmness.<br/> <br/>I''m glad to able to tell that I gave one of the 2 9-scores.</td>', 'I just don''t get it.  I mean, I don''t get how this didn''t score any higher.The simplicity, the reflection, the gradient: al these elements are contributing to the calmness in this photograph.  Looking at it, my eyes go from top left to bottom right to find a place to rest on.  This is the reed with the most sharpness and is the resting place for the eye. The fact that the other reeds are not as sharp, gives that part of the photograph calmness. I''m glad to able to tell that I gave one of the 2 9-scores.', '2010-04-28 14:26:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5977365, 871041, 28427, '<td valign="top">The photograph is well composed, nicely balanced.  Colours are very nice.  In no way there''s something negative to say upon this photograph.  Maybe people don''t really see mushrooms as Zen.  But then, Zen is not a subject, but a state of mind, being.<br/>I think that, the moment you took this photograph, you felt Zen because of the calmness, the peace, the odour of nature.</td>', 'The photograph is well composed, nicely balanced.  Colours are very nice.  In no way there''s something negative to say upon this photograph.  Maybe people don''t really see mushrooms as Zen.  But then, Zen is not a subject, but a state of mind, being.I think that, the moment you took this photograph, you felt Zen because of the calmness, the peace, the odour of nature.', '2010-04-28 14:33:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5977387, 870510, 70503, '<td valign="top">I started out trying to use candles as my shot. I couldn''t get the flames to be anything but blobs. Nice job on capturing them! The reflections are nice. Needs to be a bit more in focus, but other than that it is very Zen-like!</td>', 'I started out trying to use candles as my shot. I couldn''t get the flames to be anything but blobs. Nice job on capturing them! The reflections are nice. Needs to be a bit more in focus, but other than that it is very Zen-like!', '2010-04-28 14:46:16.000000', NULL, 0),
