(5978387, 868508, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mrbig65:</b></div><hr/><i> good one,,,,, but mabye taking little too high ?? ha humm,,,,, ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>he gave you a 4. You got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Originally posted by mrbig65: good one,,,,, but mabye taking little too high ?? ha humm,,,,, ?   he gave you a 4. You got a 7 from me.', '2010-04-28 23:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
