(5979050, 870598, 47974, '<td valign="top">Because of the thread you started I figured I would comment on some of your photos to help you improve.  I only gave this image a 4 during voting and here is why:<br/> <br/>1) While the photo is technically sound it just did not say Zen to me.<br/>2) I normally give a 5 for any photo that mets the challenge but may lower it for several reasons.  I lowered it to a 4 because if I am not mistaken the statue is actually a hindu or muslim statue.  I was tired of people photographing anything that looked asian for the challenge having no idea what it was. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Because of the thread you started I figured I would comment on some of your photos to help you improve.  I only gave this image a 4 during voting and here is why: 1) While the photo is technically sound it just did not say Zen to me.2) I normally give a 5 for any photo that mets the challenge but may lower it for several reasons.  I lowered it to a 4 because if I am not mistaken the statue is actually a hindu or muslim statue.  I was tired of people photographing anything that looked asian for the challenge having no idea what it was.  ', '2010-04-29 11:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5979153, 871605, 6349, '<td valign="top">Dude.  This is awesome.  I''m delighted and surprised to see this get a ribbon here.  I''m also delighted and surprised that this is yours.  Not that I didn''t think you took beautiful photos like this I just didn''t think you would submit them here.  Glad you took the risk and it paid off.</td>', 'Dude.  This is awesome.  I''m delighted and surprised to see this get a ribbon here.  I''m also delighted and surprised that this is yours.  Not that I didn''t think you took beautiful photos like this I just didn''t think you would submit them here.  Glad you took the risk and it paid off.', '2010-04-29 12:34:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5979165, 869899, 6349, '<td valign="top">Before I even read your notes or posthumous''s comment I was thinking "the rock makes this shot."  I''m so glad you left it in.  Most people would have cropped it out because most people are....</td>', 'Before I even read your notes or posthumous''s comment I was thinking "the rock makes this shot."  I''m so glad you left it in.  Most people would have cropped it out because most people are....', '2010-04-29 12:38:11.000000', NULL, 0),
