(5979759, 869026, 116674, '<td valign="top">haha, saw your post and thought I''d comment here instead. <br/> <br/>I love the idea for the photo. I just thought the flowers need a bit more oomph. (very technical I know). perhaps adjust the levels or contrast to bring them out? the one on the right especially.  I voted a 4, for that reason, otherwise great POV and DOF.  I would have voted around 8 it the flowers were a little more defined.  But this is only my very humble opinion</td>', 'haha, saw your post and thought I''d comment here instead.  I love the idea for the photo. I just thought the flowers need a bit more oomph. (very technical I know). perhaps adjust the levels or contrast to bring them out? the one on the right especially.  I voted a 4, for that reason, otherwise great POV and DOF.  I would have voted around 8 it the flowers were a little more defined.  But this is only my very humble opinion', '2010-04-29 19:33:22.000000', NULL, 0),
