(5980145, 869085, 40391, '<td valign="top">I was going though my high votes and was surprised to find this down where it was.  It is a lovely photo that for me screamed (quietly) Zen.  You draw me to a single aspect that is beautiful, natural and peaceful. The depth of field is spot on. I gave you a nine though it was almost lower due to the hard lines on the leave edges (possibly produced during pp).  Well done and should have finished hight IMHO.</td>', 'I was going though my high votes and was surprised to find this down where it was.  It is a lovely photo that for me screamed (quietly) Zen.  You draw me to a single aspect that is beautiful, natural and peaceful. The depth of field is spot on. I gave you a nine though it was almost lower due to the hard lines on the leave edges (possibly produced during pp).  Well done and should have finished hight IMHO.', '2010-04-29 23:13:20.000000', NULL, 0),
