(6082878, 870847, 75713, '<td valign="top">That has to be one of the best titles I ever saw - Zen means different things to different people .. I like this shot and your creativity in naming it.<br/> <br/>Case in point - one of the  many definitions of Zen on the web - a Buddhist doctrine that enlightenment can be attained through direct intuitive insight <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-07-06 22:57:58.</i></td>', 'That has to be one of the best titles I ever saw - Zen means different things to different people .. I like this shot and your creativity in naming it. Case in point - one of the  many definitions of Zen on the web - a Buddhist doctrine that enlightenment can be attained through direct intuitive insight ', '2010-07-06 23:55:30.000000', '2010-07-06 23:57:58.000000', 0),
