(6158586, 870706, 30214, '<td valign="top">lovely. but I must admit that I also don''t see a cube. I think I only see a square. On further reflection, mathematically speaking, square is a 2-dimensional cube :)</td>', 'lovely. but I must admit that I also don''t see a cube. I think I only see a square. On further reflection, mathematically speaking, square is a 2-dimensional cube :)', '2010-09-10 15:51:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6195204, 869085, 28471, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Abra:</b></div><hr/><i> I was going though my high votes and was surprised to find this down where it was.  It is a lovely photo that for me screamed (quietly) Zen.  You draw me to a single aspect that is beautiful, natural and peaceful. The depth of field is spot on. I gave you a nine though it was almost lower due to the hard lines on the leave edges (possibly produced during pp).  Well done and should have finished hight IMHO. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Originally posted by Abra: I was going though my high votes and was surprised to find this down where it was.  It is a lovely photo that for me screamed (quietly) Zen.  You draw me to a single aspect that is beautiful, natural and peaceful. The depth of field is spot on. I gave you a nine though it was almost lower due to the hard lines on the leave edges (possibly produced during pp).  Well done and should have finished hight IMHO.   Thanks!', '2010-10-18 21:58:52.000000', NULL, 0),
