(6514780, 871596, 28427, '<td valign="top">I found this photograph only now.<br/>Other people hug, kiss and talk to trees to get in touch with nature. But not Derek.  He goes into the mountains in his bare butt to meditate and proves it with a photograph.<br/>Nice score, but this deserved a higher score just for the effort you''ve put in it.<br/>Additionally to this effort, this makes a great picture: well balanced, nice composition, sharp... Great work.</td>', 'I found this photograph only now.Other people hug, kiss and talk to trees to get in touch with nature. But not Derek.  He goes into the mountains in his bare butt to meditate and proves it with a photograph.Nice score, but this deserved a higher score just for the effort you''ve put in it.Additionally to this effort, this makes a great picture: well balanced, nice composition, sharp... Great work.', '2011-08-24 18:06:42.000000', NULL, 0),
